ulation of this application does not guarantee the design, size, range of motion, etc. of the actual robot.\nWhen actually installing a robot, please check the specifications on the product page.\n- Please be careful of your surroundings when using this app.", "short_description": "You can place OVR series virtual robots in real space and simulate operation.\nThe OVR series is a robot sold by Oriental Motor."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1594860848028062", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210390_1594860854694728_1273340538204967659_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pHAhdXUfSncQ7kNvwFExTXB&_nc_oc=AdrX765qgrdoVRYFqskxpOefIgJr9ElpKoM4WG6bASyGDTQ4dZZC261Sx2pohbeBdDg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQYljeUEb313Yzm-IDJKWaJ9VJcP5hTpf2YVET6AKFeWw&oe=6AFB15D6"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtLandscapeMini.png", "id": "858590429630683", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974810_858590432964016_3799015126354441121_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CRnpZHn7KeUQ7kNvwHA1bDR&_nc_oc=AdqtM5KGHMiYDNJx9nz2jDLYmLWCPc4aVcCmYiaRmaQU0OAGiz81K6a0Z8qDicINOZ0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQIjY2tUr_Grqejn9XK8P2wdj906JKC0FygMKyNHAffRg&oe=6AFB195C"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtLandscape.png", "id": "495376463065176", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974810_495376466398509_7417159219708782199_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9CAEoUHgHd8Q7kNvwFaNZPs&_nc_oc=AdqPVhCMD5Luu_8QgokdKKa2dZzStifQ2VfZU8X1uSQPjgNVxCX7bs79jMiyYAFNUik&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQl8iaAXJtkVKx5B5aucN3cHO-BA_pot_glNv2rPzhgGg&oe=6AFB32DB"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtPortrait.png", "id": "486